	"text_info": [
		{
			"text_contents": "none",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "If ever see black\nsquid-like warrior, better run<1\"\u0000>\naway. No way, can beat it...",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Heh, heh, heh, having achieved\nyet another power-up, I'm<1\"\u0000>\nnone other than the \"<17\u0003>{9, MonsterParameter, +}<2{耀>{3, name, +}\",<1\"\u0000>\nnow known as \"<17\u0003>{9, MonsterParameter, +}<2|耀>{3, name, +}\", Denpa Men!\nIt seems you have defeated<1\"\u0000>\nthat old hag <17\u0003>{9, MonsterParameter, +}<2»耀>{3, name, +}.\nI give you some credit<1\"\u0000>\nfor that, just this time.\nHow do you feel? Must be<1\"\u0000>\namazing, right? But originally,\nyou see,...it was supposed to<1\"\u0000>\nbe me taking her down!\nNow, let's forget about<1\"\u0000>\n<17\u0003>{9, MonsterParameter, +}<2»耀>{3, name, +}!\nHeh, heh, heh, this is now<1\"\u0000>\nbetween both of us! I'll\ncompletely wipe the floor<1\"\u0000>\nwith a nobody like you!<1\"\u0000>\nThis time, I'm grand and\nglamorous! I've been training<1\"\u0000>\neven harder than ever before!\nI'm in my absolute strongest<1\"\u0000>\nform! Beeing breaking my own\npersonal best continuously!<1\"\u0000>\nLast time, I only held back\nbecause of Crystal, but<1\"\u0000>\nthis situation right now is\njust perfect, let's settle it!",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "You should have just run away\nbut I'm sure you'll quickly<1\"\u0000>\ncome to this conclusion\nyourself... You'll regret this<1\"\u0000>\nbig time!!",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "As expected, it turns out you\n<17\u0003>{9, MonsterParameter, +}<2|耀>{3, name, +} is just to terrifying<1\"\u0000>\nfor you dweebs!\nHeh, heh, heh...",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "What's this? Have you come to\npick up a fight again<1\"\u0000>\nwithout learning your lesson?",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Ugh, so I hadn't fully\nrecovered yet, huh? Once again,<1\"\u0000>\nloosing to a mere Denpa Man...\nNo! I haven't lost at all!<1\"\u0000>\nAs long as my spirit isn't\nbroken, I haven't lost!!<1\"\u0000>\nGnh, don't you dare think\nI've lost yet!!",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Hello there. I'm \"<17\u0003>{8, MessageNpcName, +}<2N耀>{4, message}\".\nNice to meet you.<1\"\u0000>\nI'm all alone and feel a bit\nlost. I'd like you to take<1\"\u0000>\nme with you.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Huh!? Thank you so much!\nI'll head over to your<1\"\u0000>\nisland right away.\nI'll be waiting for you<1\"\u0000>\nto safely come back.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Huh!? There's no space left in\nyour Denpa Men Box...<1\"\u0000>\nIf a spot opens up,\ncome back to call me again.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Huh? That's sad...\nIt's boring being all alone...",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I'm going to your island right\naway. When you come back,<1\"\u0000>\nI'd love for you to take\nme on an adventure.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "If a spot opens up in the\nDenpa Men Box, please give me<1\"\u0000>\na call, I'll be waiting.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Huh!? I want you take me\nwith you...!",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
